  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "cc",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tWhat is Symato CC?\n\t\n\nTo download all WARC data from Common Crawl then filter out Vietnamese in Markdown and Plaintext format.\nThere is 1% of Vietnamse in CC, extract all of them out should be a lot (~10TB of plaintext).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMain contributors\n\t\n\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/nampdn-ai\nhttps://huggingface.co/binhvq\nhttps://huggingface.co/th1nhng0\nhttps://huggingface.co/iambestfeed\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSimple quality filters\n\t\n\nTo make use of raw data from common crawl, you need to do filtering\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Symato/cc.",
  "alternateName": [
    "Symato/cc"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Symato Team",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/Symato"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "Vietnamese",
    "mit",
    "1K<n<10K",
    "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Region: US"
  ],
  "license": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/",
